.Dd July 31, 2026
.Dt TRACECTL 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm tracectl
.Nd validate TraceCmp authorization policy
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm configtest
.Op Ar file
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
validates the explicit-label policy used by
.Xr traced 8 ,
defaulting to
.Pa /etc/traced.allow .
It uses the daemon's parser and rejects wildcard, duplicate, malformed, and
oversized entries.
A missing or empty file is valid and means default deny.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr libtracecmp 3 ,
.Xr traced 8
